    "Duration chip is landscape-only: play + runtime, time left while in progress, checkmark when finished. Watched dim/checkmark applies to vertical posters.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duration chip is landscape-only: play + runtime, time left while in progress, checkmark when finished. Watched dim/checkmark applies to vertical posters."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Чип длительности только на горизонтальных: play + время, «осталось» в процессе, галочка когда досмотрено. Затемнение/галочка — для вертикальных постеров."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duration chip pins bottom-leading. New-episode counts (+N) render as a caption label, not a title chip. Watched dim/checkmark is for vertical posters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duration chip pins bottom-leading. New-episode counts (+N) render as a caption label, not a title chip. Watched dim/checkmark is for vertical posters."
